                    <ol class="reg  searchCenterMiddle"><li class="first"><div class="dd fst lst algo algo-sr relsrch richAlgo" data-874="63873d42eb3c6c"><div class="compTitle options-toggle"><h3 style="display:block;margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:2px;" class="title"><a style="line-height:26px" class="d-ib fz-20 lh-26 td-hu tc va-bot mxw-100p" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" href="https://r.search.yahoo.com/_ylt=AwrKHBM461xoDgIAGVK7HAx.;_ylu=Y29sbwNzZzMEcG9zAzEEdnRpZAMEc2VjA3Ny/RV=2/RE=1752129592/RO=10/RU=https%3a%2f%2fbyjus.com%2fenglish%2fprefix-and-suffix%2f/RK=2/RS=guhT5nLHKNLakEVj1ZwNReR9zn0-" data-874="63873d42ea6980" aria-label="What Is a Prefix and a Suffix? &ndash; Meaning and Definition"><span class="d-ib p-abs t-0 l-0 fz-14 lh-20 fc-obsidian wr-bw ls-n pb-4">byjus.com<span class="fc-pewter"> › english › <b>prefix</b>-and-<b>suffix</b></span></span>What Is a Prefix and a Suffix? &ndash; Meaning and Definition</a></h3><div style="visibility:hidden;"class="d-ib p-abs t-0 l-0 fz-14 lh-20 fc-obsidian wr-bw ls-n pb-4"><span>byjus.com</span><span> › english › prefix-and-suffix</span></div></div><div class="compText aAbs"><p class="fz-14 lh-22 mah-44 ov-h d-box fbox-ov fbox-lc2"> <span class="fc-falcon">In this article, you will be introduced to the meaning and definition of <b>a prefix</b> and <b>a suffix</b>, along with an extensive list of base words and their <b>prefixes</b> and <b>suffixes</b>. You will also learn how the base word and the word with the <b>prefix</b> or <b>suffix</b> change meaning and function.</span> </p></div><div class="compCardList algoCarouselModern crsl-modern caption-1"><ul class="d-f" aria-label="What Is a Prefix and a Suffix? &ndash; Meaning and Definition, carousel"><li class="first bxz-bb mr-8 mb-4 bdr-8 bd-1 w-200 fls-0 noImg" data-pos="1" aria-label="Item 1 of 6"><a target="_blank" class="td-hn-imp card" aria-label="aprefix asuffix1" referrerpolicy="origin" href="https://r.search.yahoo.com/_ylt=AwrKHBM461xoDgIAGlK7HAx.;_